<p class="citation">Mensch, T., Rasolofosaon, P. (1997). Elastic-wave velocities in anisotropic media of arbitrary symmetry - generalization of Thomsen&#39;s parameters epsilon, delta and gamma. Geophysical Journal International 128(1), 43-64. <a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-246X.1997.tb04070.x">doi:10.1111/j.1365-246X.1997.tb04070.x</a></p>
